this # Retail Sales & Inventory Analysis

This is a beginner-level data analysis project.

## Overview
This project analyzes retail sales and inventory data to understand
vendor performance and inventory issues using SQL, Python, and Power BI.

## Tools Used
- SQL
- Python
- Power BI

## Business Problem
Retail companies face problems like:
- Low sales from some vendors
- Excess inventory
- Low profit margin

## Key Insights
- Some vendors generate higher profit than others
- Bulk purchasing helps reduce cost
- Slow-moving products increase inventory cost

## Dashboard
Power BI dashboard shows sales, profit, and inventory trends.

